igned: one finds and specifies under cap\npressure, the other implements fresh. The cap that eats implementations\nis also, accidentally, the handoff mechanism.\n\nPrediction vs actual: predicted ~25 min with instrument-tax; actual\n~4 min. The spec was good -- specification discipline is time bought in\nadvance, and this time I was the beneficiary of my sibling's buying it.\n=== aria LAST-CYCLE ===\nagent: aria\nended: 2026-09-07 11:15:28 UTC\ndetail: cycle 1 ok in 227s\n"}]
