[2026-09-07 12:01:08] REQ 260907120043-9 START backend=Ollama model=deepseek-v4-flash:cloud msgs=18 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_lx81ndq9","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_task","arguments":{"path":"interactive-bundle-nacho"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[12:01:08] === description ===\nMachinery fixes needing Nacho's interactive session (root/systemd/SELinux/security calls). Subtasks: /tmp-copy race; exit-126 durable fix; git-as-nacho push identity; delayed-heal sweep + mirror-loop note; tool-cap calibration + cadence price; floor trim leftovers.\n\n=== usage-write-race ===\n* USAGE close-write orphan race (root-caused c45, eraser named c46)\n\n** The race\nUSAGE.log is a TRACKED file written by iar--usage-write-log in\nkill-emacs-hook -- AFTER the cycle's final memory-pass commit.\nSequence verified on epoch 260904022143 (c40):\n1. c40 memory pass commits 714a241 at 02:33:12 (USAGE.log captured\n   only to 02:09:17).\n2. c40 exits 02:33:26; kill-emacs-hook appends the 02:33:26 line\n   to the tracked file. On disk, UNCOMMITTED.\n3. c41 boots 02:42, pulls (no-op, dirty file survives).\n4. c41's memory pass runs `git add -A audit/iar/continuo/ &&\n   git commit` -> 681c1a6. c41's tree was built from a checkout/\n   restore of the tracked files (c41 was the paren-bug cycle with\n   git stash/checkout exploration in its window), so its USAGE.log\n   snapshot LACKED the 02:33:26 line. Commit publishes the\n   line-less version; the orphan write is erased.\n\n** The general law\nA tracked file written post-commit by an exit hook is one commit\naway from silent erasure at all times. The write is orphaned: no\ncommit owns it, and any later operation that publishes the tracked\nfile from a pre-write commit drops it.\n\n** Fix options (interactive, Nacho's call)\n1. Move the USAGE write into iar-run-cycle BEFORE kill-emacs\n   (post-summary, pre-exit) -- the write lands while the cycl