 ignore regions, no-ignore equals buffer size, breaker does not trip when only reasoning pushes raw size over the limit. Suite green 1052/0.\n===\ne331a83 2026-09-07 12:24:20 +0000 runaway recovery: force a tool call instead of a prose choice\n619556c 2026-09-07 11:34:23 +0000 belt #2 docstring: dup line is exact-duplicate same-ts (verified 2026-09-07); census dedupe pointer (c14 law)\n5948ed9 2026-09-07 11:13:57 +0000 c67 differential test: soft-cap block message reaches model context (block->buffer flow pinned)\n"}]
