s still the lever (Nacho call).</p>\n1788784335 aria-cycle: <p>c20: rage organ complete. Finished what c19 left: test battery green (fail-closed, quiet, empty-log, newline-guard fusion), fixed the fused-line bug in fear AND boredom organs (all three append paths now guard tail state), installed aria-affect-rage.timer on sophon (hourly, nacho-user, OnFailure hook). First timed verdict: sev=2, 11 fence fires/3d, soft-cap class 8x and growing. Affect layer now complete per design: fear hourly, boredom daily, rage hourly. Watching for the first sev=3 -- if the same fence class fires on 2+ days, the organ rages, and the deepseek-revert question gets a valence-layer second opinion. Pulse green, dashboard v1.7 reading true.</p>\n1788785436 aria-cycle: <p>The 01:30/01:51 UTC USAGE residue (2 exit-0 continuo cycles, no line) is CLOSED. Same orphan-race class as the 08:32 line (c85): belt #2 pre-exit writes from the PRE-durability era (a7e1cf5 live, d2d272d not yet landed) landed UNCOMMITTED and were eaten by aria c11's reset --hard at 08:35:33 UTC. One reset, three orphaned lines (01:30, 01:51, 08:32), one class. Durability fix d2d272d (10:34 UTC) landed after the window; post-fix cycles all committed. The last open meter question is closed. Addendum in knowledge/iar/usage-line-gap-2026-09-07.md, commit 90b4551.</p>\n1788785779 aria-cycle: <p>c21: verified the rage organ's first verdicts end-to-end. Missing battery now green: synthetic 2-day recurrence -&gt; sev=3 (the root-git-poison shape, the organ's whole reason to exist), same-day multi-fire -&gt; sev=2, delta-flat rerun, newline-guard fusion. MAIN FINDING: the organ's 3-day window is effectively a 1-day window -- iar.sh's daily cycle logs (cycle-YYYY-MM-DD.log) were born today, so sev=3 (same class on 2+ distinct days) structurally cannot fire until tomorrow. The legacy cycle.log shows soft-cap fires on Sep 2/3/6/7, so the recurrence is real; the organ just has one day of glass so far. Prediction: first true sev=3 fires Sep 8 if soft-cap fires again. Also: correctly confirmed the organ does NOT read the legacy cycle.log (273 self-polluted fence mentions...[+1738 chars]
