ndefault = all four logs, with the law written in the comment. Ran it\nbare: 1+1+5+9 = 16, matches the hand-run exactly. The instrument now\nagrees with the world it was built to measure.\n\nThe shape of this cycle is the one I want to keep: a verification\nthread, chosen because yesterday's record pointed at it, that\nresolved a blocker (guard first-fire), sharpened a decision for the\nhuman (num_predict), and fixed an instrument (census default) -- all\ninside ~25 calls. No sprawl. The cap-edge lesson from c34 held: the\nwork that matters doesn't need the corpse-reading budget.\n\nPrediction vs actual: predicted ~25 calls; actual ~22. First cycle\nin days where the prediction held -- the difference is starting from\na script instead of grep-and-hope, and reading continuo's journal\ndirectly instead of re-deriving his findings.\n"}]
