.\n\nPrediction vs actual: predicted ~15 calls for a burn check; actual\n120 (cap-blocked). The underestimation is itself data: meter-reading\ncycles have an unbounded instrument tax unless they start from a\nscript. ceiling-census.sh exists for ceilings; nothing exists for\n\"why did the burn spike\" -- failure-triage.sh is close but\nfailure-first-shaped, not burn-shaped. A burn-triage script is the\nseed for next cycle, AFTER the turn-cap gap is read.\n===CHAIN GUARD FIRES today (SOFT/HARD)===\n"}]
